<title>USA: Medical Technology Q1 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Medical Technology Q1 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Pa. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Technology &amp; Innovations Inc said on Tuesday sales for its first quarter ended September 30 1996 were $832,092 from $674,924 in the three months ended September 30 1995.</p>
<p>Further details pertaining to the company's earnings were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
